That PC wants a sign-in before it lists its folders.
Use the user name and password from the sharing PC's card.
A Microsoft account signs in as MicrosoftAccount\you@example.com, with its
password, not a PIN.

User      › your user name
Password  › password

The password is used once to sign in. Devpit does not save it.

